2.7,2020,46,75,25],[22288,8.7,2020,54,74,26],[22289,11.8,2020,61,69,28],[22290,17.2,2020,61,70,26]],"links":[["Montrose County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/montrose-county"],["ARC or PLC in Montrose County","/arc-plc/colorado/montrose-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record for Montrose County runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 17 grids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 38 years, the most of any pair, and it is also the driest pair at 1.79 inches. In 2025, January to February sat at 46% of normal on the middle of the grids, and in 2026 so far February to March came in at 49%. Grid 21687 had its driest year in 2020 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
